  "steps": [
    "Preheat the oven to 390°F (200°C) and line a baking tray with parchment.",
    "Spread the cauliflower and chickpeas on the tray, drizzle with the olive oil, add all the spices, salt and pepper, and toss to coat.",
    "Roast 30 to 35 min, until the cauliflower is browned at the edges and the chickpeas are crunchy.",
    "Meanwhile, blend or whisk the tahini, lemon juice, syrup, salt and pepper, adding the water gradually until creamy and pourable.",
    "Put the couscous and turmeric in a bowl, pour over the boiling water or stock, cover and let stand 10 min. Fluff with a fork.",
    "Toss the parsley, onion, cucumber, tomato, lemon juice, olive oil, salt and pepper in a bowl.",
    "Spread tahini in the base of each bowl, then add the couscous, salad, cauliflower and chickpeas. Finish with pomegranate and sesame seeds."
  ],
  "tips": [
    "Vegan. Swap the tahini sauce for hummus if you want a shortcut."
  ],
